        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-footer text-center">
        <small>
            <i class="far fa-info-circle text-info mr-2"></i>Imate dodatna pitanja? Pogledajte
            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="FAQ">ostala česta pitanja</a>,
            <a asp-controller="Guides" asp-action="All">uputstva</a> i
            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">politiku privatnosti</a>.
        </small>
    </div>
</div>